      "id": 477957,
      "username": "sanjeev.goravi",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-08-19T06:04:59.746Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/astha-pandit\">@Astha-pandit</a> Hello<br>\nif the supplier revises the invoice, create a Debit Note against the original to keep the supplier ledger correct. If the change affects stock valuation (like freight or rate correction), use a Landed Cost Voucher.</p>",
